# POC-VMS-41 qualification grader test checklist

- [ ] All four frozen cases parse and every witness is unique in the exact source bytes.
- [ ] A deterministic reference candidate reaches mechanical PASS for every case.
- [ ] Mechanical PASS remains PENDING_MANUAL_AUDIT.
- [ ] Unknown fields, booleans-as-integers and duplicate witnesses fail closed.
- [ ] Source identity, span bounds/order/hash and anchor one-to-one mapping are checked.
- [ ] Unacceptable event labels, missing required edges and unmatched edges fail.
- [ ] False MERGE and one-parent MERGE fail.
